<title>GERMANY: Venezuela to issue 7-yr mark Eurobond - WestLB.</title>
<headline>Venezuela to issue 7-yr mark Eurobond - WestLB.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Republic of Venezuela will issue a seven-year, 650 million-mark Eurobond, probably on Thursday, lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bond will carry a coupon of 10.25 or 10.50 percent and yield 430 to 450 basis points above comparable German government paper, WestLB said.</p>
<p>The bond will be the fifth mark-denominated Eurobond issued by Venezuela.</p>
</text>
